index d3f3a29..2dfdf1f 100644
--- a/doc/env_vars.md
+++ b/doc/env_vars.md
@@ -383,6 +383,28 @@ leaves the draft length alone. Read when the Generator is created. Independently
 DFlash2 runs the head and selector over only the block rows a round uses whenever the draft is
